{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_vrtx_01HUpcKsncubvSnpPP9X3mSi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. **Q22: Gradient descent?** (`06-022-gradient-descent.md`) is written and committed.\n\nThe note covers:\n- **Concept** — θ ← θ − η·∇L iterative descent\n- **Mechanism** — batch/SGD/mini-batch comparison table; Momentum → Adam (bias-corrected m̂/v̂) → AdamW (decoupled weight decay); LR warmup + cosine decay; gradient clipping at norm 1.0; exploding/vanishing gradient table\n- **Example** — Llama 3 8B QLoRA training config (AdamW, η=2e-4, 100-step warmup, cosine decay, gradient accumulation for 16 GB VRAM)\n- **Pitfalls** — Only knowing batch GD; treating Adam as a black box without mentioning AdamW's decoupled weight decay; ignoring LR schedules (warmup prevents early NaN spikes)\n\n**5 items remain** in the Next queue: Q23 (classification algorithms), Q24 (GANs), Q25 (CNN architecture), Q26 (BERT architecture), and validate."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":292,"cache_read_input_tokens":70686,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":292,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"67998beb-c655-4316-a285-98b02a73eaf6","uuid":"fb48cde2-e68d-4a93-8824-bc6660c77480"}
